CHECK:UNNECESSARY_PARENTHESES: Unnecessary parentheses around 'err_ctx == IN_KERNEL'
#109: FILE: arch/x86/kernel/cpu/mce/severity.c:305:
+	if ((mcx_cfg & MCI_CONFIG_MCAX) &&
 	    (m->status & MCI_STATUS_TCC) &&
 	    (err_ctx == IN_KERNEL))

Parentheses are not required in the following cases:

  1. Function pointer uses::

      (foo->bar)();

    could be::

      foo->bar();

  2. Comparisons in if::

      if ((foo->bar) && (foo->baz))
      if ((foo == bar))

    could be::

      if (foo->bar && foo->baz)
      if (foo == bar)

  3. addressof/dereference single Lvalues::

      &(foo->bar)
      *(foo->bar)

    could be::

      &foo->bar
      *foo->bar

